{
    "word": "salute",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "30a90c6d-1d7e-3c78-b387-7b78f58aaccf",
                "word": "salute",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "baec00bb-3b3b-409f-b13a-fbba34118991",
                        "entry_id": "30a90c6d-1d7e-3c78-b387-7b78f58aaccf",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "salutes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a7be56df-bb78-35d6-bd28-5c16cac58b7a",
                        "entry_id": "30a90c6d-1d7e-3c78-b387-7b78f58aaccf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An utterance or gesture expressing greeting or honor towards someone, (now especially) a formal, non-verbal gesture made with the arms or hands in any of various specific positions."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "85deac16-b0d5-45cd-afe6-c3937e1386e6",
                                "sense_id": "a7be56df-bb78-35d6-bd28-5c16cac58b7a",
                                "text": "The soldiers greeted the dignitaries with a crisp salute."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ed6a346-315e-4309-ba8a-62fd671c123e",
                                "sense_id": "a7be56df-bb78-35d6-bd28-5c16cac58b7a",
                                "text": "The Roman salute, in which the right arm was raised in a straight and perpendicular manner, had been adopted by D'Annunzio during his regency in Fiume. Like other rituals utilized by D'Annunzio, the salute became part of the rising fascist movement's symbolic patrimony and was inherited by Mussolini's government."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df655bce-b658-46cf-9734-8d52c1681063",
                                "sense_id": "a7be56df-bb78-35d6-bd28-5c16cac58b7a",
                                "text": "Like lines of perspective or the beams of searchlights at Nazi Party rallies that shone into the night sky where they met in an infinitely distant beyond, the arms and hands of those giving each other the Hitler salute forever approached each other but never joined."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0199cf06-ee96-459d-acb1-c7a2d21777df",
                                "sense_id": "a7be56df-bb78-35d6-bd28-5c16cac58b7a",
                                "text": "And Kaszaat let out a shriek of pure anger, bursting forwards suddenly, flinging her hand up towards Drephos as though in salute."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b8243781-cbbf-3e0e-9464-8ff1806a1d3a",
                        "entry_id": "30a90c6d-1d7e-3c78-b387-7b78f58aaccf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A kiss, offered in salutation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8255b1f5-593d-48f2-b645-26e41568ae48",
                                "sense_id": "b8243781-cbbf-3e0e-9464-8ff1806a1d3a",
                                "text": "[M]aking an apology which, not suspecting his intention, I did not understand, – he gave me a most ardent salute! I have seldom been more surprised. I had no idea of his taking such a freedom."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "85ffd1be-c764-3a73-83a8-9adee2a0d9c0",
                        "entry_id": "30a90c6d-1d7e-3c78-b387-7b78f58aaccf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A discharge of cannon or similar arms, as a mark of honour or respect."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0d605ed8-a632-3531-8925-e32364524546",
                        "entry_id": "30a90c6d-1d7e-3c78-b387-7b78f58aaccf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A pyrotechnic device primarily designed to produce a loud bang."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "397fe3a1-10ba-4cfb-a524-22a8d55f0dac",
                        "source_entry_id": "30a90c6d-1d7e-3c78-b387-7b78f58aaccf",
                        "source_sense_description": "formal gesture",
                        "target_lang_word": "приве́тствие",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "приве́тствие",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6003d6f5-cc16-3e4a-be12-10978c0aa652",
                                        "entry_id": "1d9de4cd-56f4-3655-8b52-55391a73db34",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "действие по значению гл. приветствовать"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bb522f4-1af1-42f3-84e6-ec1a6ca443f8",
                                                "sense_id": "6003d6f5-cc16-3e4a-be12-10978c0aa652",
                                                "text": "Выражение его лица оставалось бесстрастно, покуда он обходил с приветствием собравшихся гостей."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c191df82-b2ce-399f-9c55-7351a481d311",
                                        "entry_id": "1d9de4cd-56f4-3655-8b52-55391a73db34",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "обращение к кому-либо, принятое при встрече с выражением дружелюбия, доброжелательства (слова, жест, движение)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86ea7ee5-151e-43df-93b9-e28507668739",
                                                "sense_id": "c191df82-b2ce-399f-9c55-7351a481d311",
                                                "text": "Однажды утром сидел он в своём кабинете, окружённый деловыми бумагами, как вдруг услышал громкое приветствие на французском языке."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "80692640-ad24-38ab-a202-cb7d565a865d",
                                        "entry_id": "1d9de4cd-56f4-3655-8b52-55391a73db34",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "речь, слова или письменное послание, выражающие привет"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba678852-318c-4269-b861-8dd18b295cd5",
                                                "sense_id": "80692640-ad24-38ab-a202-cb7d565a865d",
                                                "text": "Чтоб рассеяться ― сел и написал две статейки ― одна для «Сибирских огней» с приветствием по случаю 25-летия этого журнала, а вторую ― приветствие «Известинцу» по случаю 30-летия …"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d16c8472-c7d1-42b5-a76d-5e86bb5ef94e",
                        "source_entry_id": "30a90c6d-1d7e-3c78-b387-7b78f58aaccf",
