                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "0118c03c-e1fd-4581-bd49-c2a8a5db7852",
                        "entry_id": "5d3f2c9b-8808-383c-b53a-d36547dfcdab",
                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "present"
                        ],
                        "form": "saluting"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "50f325be-9673-4579-a12c-e8bef8a97c98",
                        "entry_id": "5d3f2c9b-8808-383c-b53a-d36547dfcdab",
                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "saluted"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "91759f3a-ff4b-46d6-804a-1b6d5b4fcbf7",
                        "entry_id": "5d3f2c9b-8808-383c-b53a-d36547dfcdab",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "saluted"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dc8766a1-4d25-3f3f-812b-17decd4ef9cb",
                        "entry_id": "5d3f2c9b-8808-383c-b53a-d36547dfcdab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To make a gesture in honor of (someone or something)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "ambitransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "be98dd15-1d91-4bd3-911a-d034d4719d59",
                                "sense_id": "dc8766a1-4d25-3f3f-812b-17decd4ef9cb",
                                "text": "They saluted the flag as it passed in the parade."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8dc1961f-1bf6-4b3e-b833-4bdcd64a2126",
                                "sense_id": "dc8766a1-4d25-3f3f-812b-17decd4ef9cb",
                                "text": "1943 June 19, New York Times, quoted in 2000, Terry Eastland, Freedom of Expression in the Supreme Court: The Defining Cases, page 64,\nYet the simple fact stands that a school child compelled to salute the flag, when he has been taught the flag is an \"image\" which the Bible forbids him to worship, is in effect made to say what he does not believe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6c59c45-e76b-4fd2-9466-8aa5522c1c18",
                                "sense_id": "dc8766a1-4d25-3f3f-812b-17decd4ef9cb",
                                "text": "The person who salutes is slavishly obedient, fearful to offend the authorities or other people; the person who declines to salute has integrity and independence."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "13a98623-16f1-3f79-ae60-4ff95804c458",
                        "entry_id": "5d3f2c9b-8808-383c-b53a-d36547dfcdab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To act in thanks, honor, or tribute; to thank or extend gratitude; to praise."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a98e49cc-9ea1-4601-b4d8-7023892b8246",
                                "sense_id": "13a98623-16f1-3f79-ae60-4ff95804c458",
                                "text": "I would like to salute the many dedicated volunteers that make this project possible."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "58f532c7-5c08-442f-9e61-29f674935355",
                                "sense_id": "13a98623-16f1-3f79-ae60-4ff95804c458",
                                "text": "I salute every preaching and teaching woman with the courage to step out on faith and trust God with her life and her calling."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "81cd9413-f089-3564-89e1-a3406c9976c6",
                        "entry_id": "5d3f2c9b-8808-383c-b53a-d36547dfcdab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to wave, to acknowledge an acquaintance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Ireland",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33e41989-675b-476e-9366-bedc72a04713",
                                "sense_id": "81cd9413-f089-3564-89e1-a3406c9976c6",
                                "text": "I saluted Bill at the concert, but he didn't see me through the crowd."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "21a1ba13-712e-397d-bd8d-8f7cce95eae6",
                        "entry_id": "5d3f2c9b-8808-383c-b53a-d36547dfcdab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To address, as with expressions of kind wishes and courtesy; to greet; to hail."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "22d9e54e-853b-4339-b89d-880ced076853",
                                "sense_id": "21a1ba13-712e-397d-bd8d-8f7cce95eae6",
                                "text": "Then I salute you with this kingly title: / Long live Richard, England's royal king!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "323b17c4-af44-4ad6-ae70-bf1462348163",
                                "sense_id": "21a1ba13-712e-397d-bd8d-8f7cce95eae6",
                                "text": "He was saluted by Mr. James Hall, with these words: “Well, brother chip! How many murders have you been committing?”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "906840d6-9dda-312c-9749-04a8fb4b488a",
                        "entry_id": "5d3f2c9b-8808-383c-b53a-d36547dfcdab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To promote the welfare and safety of; to benefit; to gratify."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "590e074e-f14d-4884-bf64-9e432e2104ab",
                                "sense_id": "906840d6-9dda-312c-9749-04a8fb4b488a",
                                "text": "Would I had no being, / If this salute my blood a jot; it faints me, / To think what follows."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1515b1a3-9f6b-3c3f-90ef-4182208e2ab5",
                        "entry_id": "5d3f2c9b-8808-383c-b53a-d36547dfcdab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To kiss."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1de5e8c4-7262-4020-926b-cdcc1f479e51",
                                "sense_id": "1515b1a3-9f6b-3c3f-90ef-4182208e2ab5",
                                "text": "#*:Twice indeed with rapture, which once she called rude, did I salute her; and each time, resenting the freedom, did she retire […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "47f3de76-47de-458e-bf78-8424bbb4cc42",
                                "sense_id": "1515b1a3-9f6b-3c3f-90ef-4182208e2ab5",
                                "text": "[T]his young gentleman, who was naturally facetious, in taking his leave, saluted us all round. My lord, who had before entertained some jealousy of his kinsman, was very much provoked by this trifling incident […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80f34f09-fd9f-4d18-85f1-bcb47d7cedd8",
                                "sense_id": "1515b1a3-9f6b-3c3f-90ef-4182208e2ab5",
                                "text": "'I take the privilege, Mistress Ruth, of saluting you.' ...And therewith I bussed her well."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "80cbd0ac-87e2-4af8-abbe-243935f2fa35",
                        "source_entry_id": "5d3f2c9b-8808-383c-b53a-d36547dfcdab",
                        "source_sense_description": "make a gesture",
                        "target_lang_word": "приве́тствовать",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "приве́тствовать",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "802ada7c-a14a-3503-bb62-261ae0ed14ae",
                                        "entry_id": "b4c27215-8aa0-3b57-ad4a-8fd71a80adb4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "здороваться, выражать приветствие, подавать знак доброго отношения к кому-либо"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4693cda-e440-494e-bf50-749fd74a687b",
                                                "sense_id": "802ada7c-a14a-3503-bb62-261ae0ed14ae",
                                                "text": "― Бонжур, мадемуазель, ― приветствовал мисс Кингман толстяк, раскланиваясь самым галантным образом."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b21f5940-e712-422c-bf62-ed1dde51cace",
                                                "sense_id": "802ada7c-a14a-3503-bb62-261ae0ed14ae",
                                                "text": "Ровный шум быстрой реки приветствовал наш выход на берег Катуни."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f768cd08-4204-361a-abe0-240a14cbfad9",
                                        "entry_id": "b4c27215-8aa0-3b57-ad4a-8fd71a80adb4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "перен. то же, что горячо одобрять, поддерживать"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b9334b6-6c6f-427d-a497-3a348fee6356",
                                                "sense_id": "f768cd08-4204-361a-abe0-240a14cbfad9",
                                                "text": "― Я приветствовал бы тибетские монастыри как места для психологического отдыха или лечения."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f06dfe31-f39e-497d-9570-d05995c69254",
                                                "sense_id": "f768cd08-4204-361a-abe0-240a14cbfad9",
                                                "text": "Но Тексье прекрасно знал, что начальство, мягко говоря, не очень-то приветствует такие размышления, и старался скрывать их."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b916cd4-6970-3954-906b-9c408d2c417f",
                                        "entry_id": "b4c27215-8aa0-3b57-ad4a-8fd71a80adb4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "воен. отдавать воинскую честь, прикладывая руку к головному убору"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ff3916a-d7de-4818-8c84-88e8cfd84ff6",
                                                "sense_id": "5b916cd4-6970-3954-906b-9c408d2c417f",
                                                "text": "― Господин бригадный генерал, позвольте приветствовать вас на вверенном вам объекте, ― он отдал честь коротким четким взмахом руки."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2d1dfdc5-e943-42f1-b5f7-9b4afa3fd72b",
